WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.333
Marketers talk about funnels constantly.

2
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.333
Most people nod along as if they understand them.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.667
A funnel is a model of the customer decision journey.

4
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:30.667
Stages from first hearing about you to eventually buying.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.333
Stage 1: Awareness. Stage 2: Interest. Stage 3: Consideration.

6
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:47.333
Stage 4: Intent. Stage 5: Conversion. They buy.

7
00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:53.667
The critical insight: most businesses fail at Stage 1, not Stage 5.

8
00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:59.667
Great product, great checkout, but nobody knows they exist.

9
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:05.333
Each stage needs different strategy. Marketers who know this build systems.

10
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn digital marketing at 0xverse Academy.

